Package: oneearthr
Type: Package
Title: Access the One Earth Bioregions Framework Spatial Layers
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Angel", "Robles", , "a.l.robles.fernandez@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4674-4270"))
Description: Access the One Earth Bioregions Framework: ecoregions,
    bioregions, subrealms, and biogeographical realms. Ships simplified
    versions of all four layers (topology-preserving simplification,
    0.02–0.15 degree tolerance) for lightweight offline use, and provides
    functions to download the full-resolution geometries on demand.
    Packaged data are redistributed under their original licenses
    (RESOLVE Ecoregions 2017, CC-BY 4.0; One Earth Bioregions Framework,
    CC BY-NC 4.0); see inst/COPYRIGHTS.
